  "title": "Patricia K Probable NDE 8279",
  "date": "12/21/1986",
  "content": "I felt peace and was so happy to be relieved from suffering. I looked down at my body lying in the delivery room. I knew that I and the twins had died from sepsis. I followed the light. My Grandmother spoke to me and asked, 'Why are you here?' I replied by thinking, 'I need to take care of the twins.' Grandma told me, 'We will take care of the twins. You need to go back because you have more work to do.' At that point, I was returned to my body. This made me angry. How could God take away my children?! After I left the hospital, I was angry-very angry that God would kill my children. On three separate occasions, my Grandmother came back to me in like a dream but it was not a dream. She showed me Heaven. She was trying to save my soul and show me what to expect. She showed me that God's love was all around us. She took me back in time to show my what she looked like at age 33, which was my age at the time of the experience. She showed me her black and white polka dot dress, the colors,songs, and the love of God. My anger turned to love. The meaning of life is love. God loves all rreligions, not any particular religion. Life is a gift to get closer to God when we pass. Only the brave souls come to Earth.",
